MODEL WATCH #51 — Tuesday, September 1, 2026

1. PELAGIC 2.5: REASONING MODE, SAME PRICE, MORE TOKENS
Pelagic 2.5 with extended reasoning enabled vs. disabled, on our reasoning set (200 tasks):

  Mode           Score   Median out tokens   Median cost/task
  Reasoning off   84.0        410               $0.0041
  Reasoning on    90.7       1,880              $0.0188
  Reasoning on, cap 800   88.9   790            $0.0079

The cap gets you most of the gain at 40% of the cost. We recommend the cap as the default.

2. WHAT REASONING TOKENS ACTUALLY COST ACROSS LABS
Every lab bills reasoning as output. Effective cost per reasoning-mode task on the same 200 items:

  Lodestone-R1     $0.061
  Pelagic 2.5      $0.019
  Sable-3 (think)  $0.024
  Quillon-L        n/a (no reasoning mode)

3. TANAGER-CODER 2 (OPEN, 34B)
Agentic coding score 71.2, second overall and first among open models. Single 80GB card at 38 tokens/sec in our setup. https://modelwatch.dev/models/tanager-coder-2

4. PRICE CHANGES THIS WEEK
  Sable Labs: no change
  Pelagic: reasoning mode included at base price (new)
  Kestrel: Tanager-Coder 2 listed at $0.30 / $0.90

